Portage installs and updates me3 and the manager on Linux: don't check either
for updates at start, hide the install, update, change version and uninstall
buttons (they pipe upstream's installer.sh to sh, which installs a user copy
in ~/.local that shadows the system one), and hide the "check for ME3 updates"
setting that no longer does anything. Windows is unchanged.

